        <type>int32</type>
        <definition>int32 UTryllKvResidencyPolicy::HotSetSize</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>HotSetSize</name>
        <qualifiedname>UTryllKvResidencyPolicy::HotSetSize</qualifiedname>
        <initializer>= 2</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>How many agents keep their contexts resident, including the active one.</para>
<para>Two is the useful default: &quot;go back to the one I was just using&quot; is the commonest pattern, and a hot set of one punishes it with a full restore every time. One maximises the saving. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
